    man "我们的测试对象现在已经准备就绪。"

# game/episode022.rpy:244
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_61da8a70:

    # shk "The current subject has already undergone multiple transfusions and is well on the path of true enlightenment."
    shk "当前对象已经接受了多次输注，正稳步迈向真正的启蒙之路。"

# game/episode022.rpy:245
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5f52c85f:

    # shk "Increased heat resistance, heightened synapse discharge and a strengthened muscular system are all traits we took from the inferior races and already transfused into this subject."
    shk "增强的耐热性、提升的突触放电能力以及强化的肌肉系统，这些都是我们从劣等种族获取并已输注给该对象的特性。"

# game/episode022.rpy:246
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_52e381c8:

    # shk "Today we’re adding the unique mental properties of the Diclonae."
    shk "今天我们正在添加狄克洛尼人的独特精神特性。"

# game/episode022.rpy:247
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_bec0e900:

    # shk "Please start the procedure on my mark."
    shk "请根据我的指令开始手术。"

# game/episode022.rpy:249
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5d268192:

    # "Some of the lab workers started entering command sequences into their computer terminals."
    "一些实验室工作人员开始在他们的计算机终端输入命令序列。"

# game/episode022.rpy:273
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_7fe03108:

    # "The test subject on the table was now covered in energy beams of a different color compared to those who were blasted at the Diclonae."
    "手术台上的测试对象现在被不同颜色的能量光束覆盖，与照射狄克洛尼人的光束相比。"

# game/episode022.rpy:274
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a557bbe1:

    # "The transfusion process also seemed less painful for the new host."
    "对新宿主的输血过程似乎也不那么痛苦。"

# game/episode022.rpy:275
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f411b174:

    # c "So, we’ve stumbled on another eugenics project."
    c "那么，我们又碰到了一个优生学项目。"

# game/episode022.rpy:277
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c3cfad89:

    # na "It seems so."
    na "看起来是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:278
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_8da960f6:

    # c "Can’t deny I’m a little disappointed."
    c "不能否认我有点失望。"

# game/episode022.rpy:279
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_4e435425:

    # c "Yet another bunch of sadistic aliens with a god-complex, murdering innocents to enhance themselves."
    c "又是另一群有上帝情结的虐待狂外星人，通过杀害无辜者来增强自己。"

# game/episode022.rpy:281
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_74ff7e59:

    # na "It’s an age-old practice, unfortunately."
    na "不幸的是，这是一种古老的做法。"

# game/episode022.rpy:282
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_45049574:

    # na "I’m not sure how successful this civilization on Petrarch was, to be honest, I’ve never heard of this transfusion process."
    na "老实说，我不确定彼特拉克星上的这个文明有多成功，我从没听说过这种输血过程。"

# game/episode022.rpy:284
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_3b4b55fb:

    # "Our attention was drawn to the scientist and the subject on the table again."
    "我们的注意力再次被吸引到科学家和桌子上的实验对象身上。"

# game/episode022.rpy:285
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c730b52a:

    # shk "The transfusion is complete, Your Majesty."
    shk "输血完成了，陛下。"

# game/episode022.rpy:287
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_cbbddb51:

    # th "Wish he’d drop the whole “Your Majesty” crap."
    th "真希望他能别再用那套\"陛下\"的废话。"

# game/episode022.rpy:289
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_60979edf:

    # c "He’d probably lose his head if he didn’t use those honorifics."
    c "如果他不使用这些尊称，很可能会掉脑袋。"

# game/episode022.rpy:290
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_1b5528fb:

    # na "From what we’ve heard so far of them, I don’t think they’re a very forgiving kind of people."
    na "从我们目前听到的情况来看，我不认为他们是那种很宽容的人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:292
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_212b4acf:

    # shk "Allow the test subject to demonstrate the newly transfused abilities."
    shk "让实验对象展示新获得的输血能力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:293
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_42d2e38d:

    # shk "The transfusion has strengthened the mind of the subject as is about to become clear."
    shk "输血增强了实验对象的精神力，这一点即将变得显而易见。"

# game/episode022.rpy:295
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_54b73645:

    # "The view switched to the test subject looking at a metallic object."
    "画面切换到实验对象注视着一个金属物体。"

# game/episode022.rpy:297
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_ef757bf5:

    # "The alien appeared to be concentrating very hard on the object and we waited for something to happen."
    "那个外星人似乎在全神贯注地盯着那个物体，我们等待着发生些什么。"

# game/episode022.rpy:309
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b7102d52:

    # "Slowly, but surely, the object began to rise from the tabletop, until it hovered a few inches above it."
    "缓慢但稳定地，那个物体开始从桌面升起，直到悬浮在几英寸高的空中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:310
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d8bd1d6b:

    # c "Woah, he’s making it float with his mind?"
    c "哇，他是在用念力让它漂浮吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:312
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c3cfad89_1:

    # na "It seems so."
    na "看起来是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:314
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_38e4fbf5:

    # th "That has to be some kind of trick."
    th "这一定是某种把戏。"

# game/episode022.rpy:315
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_e607735f:

    # c "Unlikely, lying to a king would be unwise, especially with the threat of beheadings and all."
    c "不太可能，对国王撒谎可不明智，尤其还有斩首之类的威胁。"

# game/episode022.rpy:317
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_40cbd290:

    # shk "The test subject has fully incorporated the mental capabilities of the lesser species and is another step toward full enlightenment."
    shk "实验对象已完全融合了次等物种的精神能力，向完全启蒙又迈进了一步。"

# game/episode022.rpy:318
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_008790b9:

    # c "A little ironic calling all the other aliens lesser beings, but stealing their special characteristics to use on yourself."
    c "一边称所有其他外星人为次等生物，一边窃取他们的特性为己所用，有点讽刺啊。"

# game/episode022.rpy:320
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_de66f6f5:

    # "Another scientist approached the one currently speaking to us."
    "另一名科学家走向正在对我们说话的那位。"

# game/episode022.rpy:321
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_8f545a82:

    # shk "I told you not to disturb us."
    shk "我告诉过你别来打扰我们。"

# game/episode022.rpy:322
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_71c62419:

    # man2 "I’m sorry, sir, but there’s been a security incident."
    man2 "抱歉长官，但发生了安全事件。"

# game/episode022.rpy:323
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_04fe8219:

    # shk "An incident?"
    shk "一起事件？"

# game/episode022.rpy:324
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_09e76e55:

    # shk "Why has the alarm not sounded?"
    shk "为什么警报没有响？"

# game/episode022.rpy:326
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_82f5e810:

    # "As if on queue, a great many sirens began to blare."
    "仿佛接到指令般，大量警报声开始响起。"

# game/episode022.rpy:327
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_06452061:

    # man2 "There’s an invasion force at our doorstep, sir."
    man2 "有支入侵部队已兵临城下，大人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:328
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b573abbb:

    # shk "Impossible!"
    shk "不可能！"

# game/episode022.rpy:329
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b5578ee8:

    # man2 "They came out of nowhere."
    man2 "他们不知从何处冒出来的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:331
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_9882abdc:

    # shk "Which breed of mongrels have dared to defy us?"
    shk "是哪个杂种部落胆敢反抗我们？"

# game/episode022.rpy:332
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_bc6b436b:

    # man2 "It’s an alliance of the lesser races, sir."
    man2 "是低等种族组成的联盟，大人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:333
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_1556eb04:

    # man2 "They’ve come to put a stop to us."
    man2 "他们是来阻止我们的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:334
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d7cfcdd9:

    # man2 "Bombardments have already started."
    man2 "轰炸已经开始了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:336
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f8026d6b:

    # shk "They will never destroy us."
    shk "他们永远无法摧毁我们。"

# game/episode022.rpy:337
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_2534e603:

    # shk "Keep filming, we’ll record their defeat for the enjoyment of the future generations of our glorious race."
    shk "继续拍摄，我们要记录下他们的败绩，供我们光荣种族未来世代享乐。"

# game/episode022.rpy:338
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_bef08778:

    # c "I guess they’re finally getting their just reward."
    c "我想他们终于得到应有的报应了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:340
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_0431e39e:

    # "The simulation pixellated again and now we were standing outside, overlooking the field outside the temple."
    "模拟画面再次出现像素化，现在我们正站在外面，俯瞰神庙外的原野。"

# game/episode022.rpy:341
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_53757911:

    # "Several soldiers were holding the scientists at gunpoint."
    "几名士兵正用枪指着科学家们。"

# game/episode022.rpy:344
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b92db381:

    # man "Your reign of terror ends here, Shixses scum."
    man "你们希克塞斯渣滓的恐怖统治到此为止了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:347
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_66597e2e:

    # shk "You think you can defeat us?"
    shk "你们以为能打败我们？"

# game/episode022.rpy:348
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_0aaec02a:

    # shk "We are your masters in everything!"
    shk "我们在各方面都是你们的主宰！"

# game/episode022.rpy:350
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d8d38a89:

    # man "Not for long."
    man "不会太久了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:351
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c61c757f:

    # man "The plague will kill you soon enough."
    man "这场瘟疫很快就会要了你们的命。"

# game/episode022.rpy:353
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_9092e245:

    # shk "Fool, we are immune to the diseases you weaklings contract."
    shk "蠢货，你们这些弱者感染的疾病对我们无效。"

# game/episode022.rpy:355
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_3dbd2677:

    # man "That may be true."
    man "或许确实如此。"

# game/episode022.rpy:356
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a9ab7767:

    # man "But the bio-engineered virus we’re about to release is sure to kill you."
    man "但我们即将释放的生物工程病毒必定能杀死你们。"

# game/episode022.rpy:357
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_933bfc24:

    # man "Believe me, the test subjects of your supposed master race begged to be killed when they slowly perished."
    man "相信我，你们所谓优等民族的实验对象在缓慢死亡时都乞求被了结。"

# game/episode022.rpy:359
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_06e3eccf:

    # shk "Lies."
    shk "谎言。"

# game/episode022.rpy:361
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_34221d12:

    # man "You’ll find out soon enough."
    man "你们很快就会明白的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:362
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_bb6f0956:

    # man "Now move aside and give us access to your laboratory."
    man "现在让开，让我们进入你们的实验室。"

# game/episode022.rpy:364
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f8fb3476:

    # shk "I would never give a mongrel like you access to our life’s work, even if I could."
    shk "我绝不会让你这种杂种接触我们毕生的心血，即便我有这个能力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:366
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5df0672a:

    # man "What do you mean?"
    man "你什么意思？"

# game/episode022.rpy:367
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_4258e90d:

    # shk "The laboratory, like any of the other labs on Petrarch, has been sealed as soon as the third-stage alarm sounded."
    shk "实验室，就像彼特拉克上其他所有实验室一样，在第三阶段警报响起时就已经被封锁了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:368
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_641b224b:

    # shk "You’ll never gain entry."
    shk "你永远无法进入。"

# game/episode022.rpy:369
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_6b2090c9:

    # shk "Even we no longer have access."
    shk "甚至连我们自己也无法再进入。"

# game/episode022.rpy:371
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d708d801:

    # "The soldier appeared fazed by this statement and conferred with his squad."
    "这名士兵似乎被这句话震慑住了，与他的小队商议起来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:372
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_6aab6da1:

    # man "I guess we’ll just have to nuke the place."
    man "看来我们只能把这个地方炸平了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:374
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f969b5a2:

    # man2 "Sir, I’ve just had reports from elsewhere on Petrarch."
    man2 "长官，我刚收到彼特拉克其他地方的报告。"

# game/episode022.rpy:375
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5088bdd9:

    # man2 "Several nuclear detonations have executed and all of the labs still stand."
    man2 "几处核爆已经执行，但所有实验室依然屹立不倒。"

# game/episode022.rpy:376
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_592d08eb:

    # man "Impossible!"
    man "不可能！"

# game/episode022.rpy:378
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f03c50bf:

    # "The Shixses scientist began to laugh manically."
    "希克塞斯科学家开始疯狂地大笑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:379
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c4b11fec:

    # man "I guess we have to let the gas do its work then."
    man "看来我们只能让毒气发挥作用了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:380
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_eb2a4837:

    # man "Laugh all you want because of your small triumph, but you’ll wish I’d shot you in the head soon enough."
    man "为你们这点小胜利尽情嘲笑吧，但很快你们就会希望我刚才一枪爆了你们的头。"

# game/episode022.rpy:382
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_1bc3ebfe:

    # "With those word, the squadron of soldiers left."
    "随着这些话，那支士兵小队离开了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:384
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_733d252d:

    # "The simulation skipped to another moment ahead in time."
    "模拟画面快进到了之后的某个时刻。"

# game/episode022.rpy:385
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_0119655f:

    # "Great noxious-looking clouds billowed over the field in front of the temple, now strewn with the bodies of many Shixses."
    "浓重恶臭的云雾在神庙前的战场上翻涌，那里如今散落着无数希克塞斯人的尸体。"

# game/episode022.rpy:386
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5398f068:

    # "Screams and rattling cries of death filled the air."
    "空气中充斥着尖叫声与垂死的嘶哑哀鸣。"

# game/episode022.rpy:387
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_fddfbccd:

    # "The scientist who’d spoken to the soldiers collapsed on the ground, clutching his chest."
    "先前与士兵交谈的那位科学家倒在地上，双手紧捂胸口。"

# game/episode022.rpy:388
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_3886a6e9:

    # "The angle of the recording skewed weirdly as well and we found ourselves level with the floor."
    "录像的角度也变得诡异扭曲，我们的视线降到了与地面齐平。"

# game/episode022.rpy:390
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a7eaf842:

    # shk "This...{w} This is the end."
    shk "这…{w}这就是终局了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:391
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d37eee7f:

    # shk "The lesser races have committed genocide."
    shk "那些低等种族实施了种族灭绝。"

# game/episode022.rpy:392
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_fa910473:

    # shk "I’m...{w} I’m afraid you’ll never see this recording of our glorious work, Your Majesty."
    shk "恐怕…{w}恐怕陛下您永远无法目睹我们辉煌成果的这段记录了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:393
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_9e0e2831:

    # shk "But know that contingencies are in place."
    shk "但请知晓，应急预案已经启动。"

# game/episode022.rpy:394
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_3150fb5d:

    # shk "We’ve spread a cryptic record of our accomplishments in a great many systems across the galaxy."
    shk "我们已在银河系众多星系中散布了我们成就的隐秘记录。"

# game/episode022.rpy:395
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_ec73fbf7:

    # shk "A prophecy that’s bound to attract attention from curious minds, ripe for their own journey toward enlightenment."
    shk "一个必将吸引好奇者注意的预言，他们已为开启自身启蒙之旅做好准备。"

# game/episode022.rpy:396
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a78c5d2a:

    # shk "Even if we’re completely wiped out by those treacherous weaklings we were supposed to rule over."
    shk "即便我们被那些本该受我们统治的卑劣弱者彻底消灭。"

# game/episode022.rpy:397
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b21acd8a:

    # shk "Another species will pick up our mantle and continue our great endeavor."
    shk "也会有其他种族接过我们的衣钵，继续我们伟大的事业。"

# game/episode022.rpy:398
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_206a5d1f:

    # shk "Our temples will unlock themselves again on their arrival, bestowing our knowledge."
    shk "我们的神庙将在他们抵达时再度开启，赐予他们我们的知识。"

# game/episode022.rpy:399
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_be0a1ef8:

    # shk "They will better themselves and erect a glorious monument in our memory."
    shk "他们将完善自我，并建立起纪念我们的辉煌丰碑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:400
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_aa3d9454:

    # shk "The end...{w} It comes..."
    shk "终结…{w}降临了…"

# game/episode022.rpy:401
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_9a93ab3a:

    # shk "It cleanses!"
    shk "它在净化！"

# game/episode022.rpy:403
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_4f9503e4:

    # shk "It cl...{w} ean...{w} s...{w} es..."
    shk "它在…{w}净…{w}化…{w}着…"

# game/episode022.rpy:408
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f9493663:

    # "The simulation cut out at this point and we were back in the temple."
    "此时模拟突然中断，我们回到了神庙之中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:409
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d12fa3f5:

    # th "Fuck."
    th "操。"

# game/episode022.rpy:410
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_fbe261dd:

    # th "I really didn’t need to see all that."
    th "我真的不想看到这些。"

# game/episode022.rpy:411
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_ac2bea30:

    # c "Me neither."
    c "我也是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:412
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_335795f6:

    # c "Though it did make some things a lot clearer."
    c "不过它确实让很多事情更清楚了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:413
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b7671da0:

    # c "Those Shixses spread the Prophecy to lure people here."
    c "那些希克塞斯人散布预言就是为了引诱人们来这里。"

# game/episode022.rpy:415
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c756ce9b:

    # c "Have you ever heard about a genocide on Petrarch, mom?"
    c "妈妈，你听说过彼特拉克星上的种族灭绝吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:417
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a1e0a36f:

    # c "Have you ever heard about a genocide on Petrarch, Nadya?"
    c "娜迪亚，你听说过彼特拉克星上的种族灭绝吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:419
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d8763a46:

    # na "I’ve never even heard of Petrarch before, nor of the Shixses or a genocide by a targeted virus."
    na "我以前从没听说过彼特拉克星，也没听说过希克塞斯人，更没听说过有针对性的病毒种族灭绝。"

# game/episode022.rpy:420
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_2d9c8828:

    # na "Their eradication must have been complete, all records were scrubbed."
    na "他们的灭绝一定很彻底，所有记录都被抹去了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:422
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d7ae0fa8:

    # th "Except for the simulation we’ve just witnessed and the databanks supposedly waiting to be unlocked."
    th "除了我们刚刚目睹的模拟记录，以及那些据说等待被解锁的数据库。"

# game/episode022.rpy:423
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5b970f84:

    # c "I’m fairly certain we unlocked those temples."
    c "我相当确定是我们解锁了那些神庙。"

# game/episode022.rpy:424
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_74cfca1a:

    # c "Were we scanned when we set foot on Petrarch?"
    c "我们踏上彼特拉克时被扫描了吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:426
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_5bef2cca:

    # th "I don’t know, it could be?"
    th "我不确定，有可能吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:427
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_9825b369:

    # c "The Shixses were hoping for someone to inherit their research."
    c "希克塞斯人是希望有人能继承他们的研究。"

# game/episode022.rpy:428
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_72fecd39:

    # c "I sure as hell don’t want anything to do with that eugenics program they were running."
    c "我绝对不想跟他们那个优生学计划扯上任何关系。"

# game/episode022.rpy:430
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_d828b031:

    # na "Me neither, but Agust wants to."
    na "我也是，但阿古斯特想要。"

# game/episode022.rpy:432
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_2cf8adcd:

    # th "And I guess the Confessor craves for a chance to do some of those magic tricks of his for real."
    th "而且我猜\"忏悔者\"渴望有机会把他那些魔术把戏变成真的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:433
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f996682b:

    # th "I mean we all saw that test subject levitate an object with its mind."
    th "我是说我们都看到那个实验对象用意念让物体悬浮了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:434
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_815e38f8:

    # c "Yes, I guess something like that would elevate his parlor tricks."
    c "是的，我猜类似的能力能提升他的客厅把戏。"

# game/episode022.rpy:435
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_b75b694d:

    # c "I think it’s clear what we need to do."
    c "我想我们需要做什么已经很明确了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:436
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_72bafa3e:

    # c "We need to blow up this place as soon as possible."
    c "我们得尽快把这个地方炸掉。"

# game/episode022.rpy:438
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_1f573468:

    # na "But how?"
    na "但怎么炸？"

# game/episode022.rpy:439
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_25aef142:

    # na "Nuclear explosions supposedly didn’t make a dent in those buildings."
    na "据说核爆炸都没能对这些建筑造成任何损伤。"

# game/episode022.rpy:440
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_33755c1b:

    # c "True, but we have access to the interior of those buildings."
    c "没错，但我们可以进入这些建筑的内部。"

# game/episode022.rpy:441
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_1a95398e:

    # c "Thyia, do you think you can rig something to get it to explode inside?"
    c "塞娅，你觉得你能在里面装点什么让它从内部爆炸吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:443
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_c79bbcd0:

    # th "Yes, we have some supplies on the Bastard and there’s enough lying around inside the compound to build something."
    th "可以，\"私生子\"号上有些补给品，而且这个建筑群内部散落着足够多的材料来制造点东西。"

# game/episode022.rpy:444
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_995847df:

    # c "Good, we’ll start with this temple here and work our way through the remaining buildings."
    c "很好，我们就从这个神庙开始，然后逐个处理剩下的建筑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:446
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_a79487b1:

    # na "That’s going to take a while."
    na "这得花上一段时间。"

# game/episode022.rpy:447
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_f7400097:

    # c "I don’t care."
    c "我不在乎。"

# game/episode022.rpy:448
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_dc1cfa50:

    # c "This research should never fall into my father’s hands, or anyone, for that matter."
    c "这项研究绝不能落入我父亲手中，或者任何其他人手里。"

# game/episode022.rpy:450
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_e4268d37:

    # th "No argument there."
    th "对此没有异议。"

# game/episode022.rpy:451
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_93837ad5:

    # th "Let’s head back so we can start working on those explosives."
    th "我们回去吧，这样就能开始制作那些炸药了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:465
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_203b710f:

    # "Céline took us back to the compound where we brought everyone up to speed with what we just learned."
    "瑟琳带我们回到了大院，我们把刚了解到的消息同步给了所有人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:466
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_simulation_bc8a95de:

    # "Thyia and Jade told everyone what sort of tech to gather in order to make the required bombs."
    "塞娅和杰德告诉大家需要收集哪些技术设备来制造所需的炸弹。"

# game/episode022.rpy:513
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_700ee8a8:

    # "Eva was pulling cables out of the wall when I found her."
    "当我找到伊娃时，她正在从墙上扯出电缆。"

# game/episode022.rpy:514
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_14185f68:

    # c "Seems like you enjoy ripping out that shit."
    c "看起来你很享受把这些东西扯出来的感觉。"

# game/episode022.rpy:515
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_62698661:

    # e "Gives me something to vent my frustration."
    e "这能让我发泄一下挫败感。"

# game/episode022.rpy:516
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_3fc15ae0:

    # c "Are you okay?"
    c "你还好吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:518
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_e2cae267:

    # e "I’m just glad I didn’t have to watch that simulation you saw."
    e "我只是庆幸自己不用看你看到的那段模拟影像。"

# game/episode022.rpy:519
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_4f532b10:

    # e "How could they do something like that?"
    e "他们怎么能做出那样的事？"

# game/episode022.rpy:520
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_f9eaba3a:

    # c "Harvest other species, you mean?"
    c "收割其他物种，你是说这个意思吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:522
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:523
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_0cad46cd:

    # c "They were pretty full of themselves, so I guess at some point they didn’t view other beings as real living things anymore."
    c "他们当时相当自以为是，所以我猜想在某个阶段他们就不再视其他生命为真正的生灵了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:525
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_dd475dda:

    # e "And we unlocked all that again."
    e "而我们把这一切又重新开启了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:526
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_46c3a7e1:

    # c "We did, but we’re also going to bury it for good again."
    c "确实如此，但我们也要再次将其彻底埋葬。"

# game/episode022.rpy:527
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_5cdee39e:

    # e "Will it work, blowing up that temple, I mean?"
    e "炸毁那座神庙会有效果吗？我是说这个计划。"

# game/episode022.rpy:528
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_fa728664:

    # c "Thyia is pretty confident it will."
    c "塞娅相当有信心会成功。"

# game/episode022.rpy:529
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_240c6e48:

    # c "Then we’re going to move onto the other buildings, make sure nothing remains."
    c "然后我们会继续摧毁其他建筑，确保什么都不留下。"

# game/episode022.rpy:531
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_c4b301f6:

    # e "Good, I want it all to burn."
    e "很好，我要让这一切都化为灰烬。"

# game/episode022.rpy:532
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_20c70dc1:

    # c "That’s the plan."
    c "这正是计划。"

# game/episode022.rpy:534
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_e8bba641:

    # e "This is what dad and all those other people are after, isn’t it?"
    e "这就是爸爸和所有那些人想要的东西，对吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:536
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_e8f46d4d:

    # e "This is what your dad and all those other people are after, isn’t it?"
    e "这就是你爸爸和所有那些人想要的东西，对吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:537
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_058dd7b5:

    # c "Yes, I think so."
    c "是的，我想是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:539
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_ccb4f47a:

    # c "It aligns with the prophecy and it certainly seems like something that would get our father’s heart pumping faster."
    c "这与预言相符，而且这确实像是会让我们的父亲心跳加速的事情。"

# game/episode022.rpy:541
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_868d79c5:

    # c "It aligns with the prophecy and it certainly seems like something that would get my father’s heart pumping faster."
    c "这与预言相符，而且这确实像是会让我的父亲心跳加速的事情。"

# game/episode022.rpy:543
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_8ffe2127:

    # e "What do you think their endgame is?"
    e "你认为他们的最终目标是什么？"

# game/episode022.rpy:544
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_46e2c341:

    # c "I think they all want to harness the power stored in the genetic databanks of the Shixses in some way."
    c "我认为他们都想以某种方式利用储存在希克塞斯基因数据库中的力量。"

# game/episode022.rpy:545
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_784937bc:

    # c "The Confessor likely wants to expand the influence of his cult."
    c "忏悔者\"很可能想要扩大他那个邪教的影响力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:546
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_aa2afdca:

    # c "Vess told us that he resorts to stage tricks to fool his audience into thinking he has real powers."
    c "薇丝告诉我们他依靠舞台伎俩来欺骗观众，让他们以为他拥有真正的力量。"

# game/episode022.rpy:547
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_b3a4c19a:

    # c "The information from the Shixses would at the very least grant him some of those powers, maybe even more than that."
    c "来自希克塞斯的信息至少能赋予他一些那样的力量，甚至可能更多。"

# game/episode022.rpy:548
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_88f1de50:

    # c "I’m not sure what Erylin’s deal is, she probably just wants to stick to someone powerful."
    c "我不确定艾瑞琳打的什么算盘，她可能只是想依附某个有权势的人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:549
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_55fcf895:

    # c "She’s a schemer, so I guess she’ll choose the side that benefits her most."
    c "她是个阴谋家，所以我猜她会选择对她最有利的一方。"

# game/episode022.rpy:551
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_f07ed0a4:

    # e "And the Confessor is on that side."
    e "而\"忏悔者\"就在那一边。"

# game/episode022.rpy:552
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_012f9024:

    # c "For now at least."
    c "至少目前是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:553
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_3254c560:

    # c "As for the Bloodhound, Kvi, I don’t know exactly what her game is."
    c "至于\"猎犬\"克薇，我不太清楚她的真实意图。"

# game/episode022.rpy:554
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_960eae5d:

    # c "She seems to relish in the cruelty of her job, that’s for sure."
    c "但可以确定的是，她似乎很享受这份工作的残忍性。"

# game/episode022.rpy:555
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_d64c40a1:

    # c "But ultimately she’s still an employee of the Department of Justice, not of the Sovereignty council, nor the Navy."
    c "不过说到底，她仍然是司法部的雇员，既不属于\"至高权域\"议会，也不属于舰队。"

# game/episode022.rpy:557
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_7d475b98:

    # c "So either she’s still spying on our dad, playing the long game, or acting as a free agent."
    c "所以要么她仍在暗中监视我们老爸，放长线钓大鱼，要么就是作为自由特工行动。"

# game/episode022.rpy:559
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_90201c41:

    # c "So either she’s still spying on my dad, playing the long game, or acting as a free agent."
    c "所以要么她仍在暗中监视我父亲，放长线钓大鱼，要么就是作为自由特工行动。"

# game/episode022.rpy:560
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_9c416c78:

    # e "From what little interaction I’ve had with her, she sure seems slippery."
    e "从我和她有限的接触来看，她确实显得很狡猾。"

# game/episode022.rpy:562
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_bddd0fc2:

    # c "As for our father, it’s pretty clear he’s become even more drunk on power and influence."
    c "至于我们的父亲，很明显他变得更加醉心于权力和影响力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:564
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_b9563f83:

    # c "As for my father, it’s pretty clear he’s become even more drunk on power and influence."
    c "至于我的父亲，很明显他变得更加醉心于权力和影响力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:565
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_d311adb6:

    # c "I’m very sure he’s not pursuing the prophecy for the expansion of the Sovereignty’s sphere of influence, or consolidating its power."
    c "我非常确定他追求预言不是为了扩展\"至高权域\"的势力范围，也不是为了巩固其权力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:566
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_b0467003:

    # c "He’s realized something about the prophecy, something that will gain the definitive upper hand or make him even more rich."
    c "他意识到了关于预言的某些东西，某些能让他获得决定性优势或让他更加富有的东西。"

# game/episode022.rpy:567
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_cfaa9787:

    # c "So I guess transforming yourself into some superhuman with ancient alien tech soaked in innocent blood fits right up his alley."
    c "所以我猜利用浸泡在无辜鲜血中的远古外星科技把自己改造成某种超人类，这正合他的胃口。"

# game/episode022.rpy:569
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_f05bb2d2:

    # e "Money and power..."
    e "金钱和权力…"

# game/episode022.rpy:570
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_dabb18fb:

    # e "It’s sad really."
    e "这真的很可悲。"

# game/episode022.rpy:571
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_4c243849:

    # c "It certainly is, if it wasn’t so evil as well."
    c "确实如此，如果不是这么邪恶的话。"

# game/episode022.rpy:573
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_600c6235:

    # e "Do you think he’s beyond redemption?"
    e "你觉得他还有救赎的可能吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:574
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_058dd7b5_1:

    # c "Yes, I think so."
    c "是的，我认为没有。"

# game/episode022.rpy:575
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_ae41ee48:

    # c "We don’t know half of what he did to consolidate his grip on the Sovereignty council, but the parts we know about are pretty damning."
    c "他为了巩固在\"至高权域\"议会中的掌控力所做的事，我们所知连一半都不到，但已知的部分就足够骇人听闻了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:576
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_ad874130:

    # c "I mean, he firebombed a planet just to get access to a monument."
    c "我是说，他为了接近一座纪念碑就直接用燃烧弹轰炸了一整颗行星。"

# game/episode022.rpy:578
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_9e894abe:

    # e "All the more reason to obliterate this place."
    e "这就更有理由要彻底摧毁这个地方了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:579
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_23e0a2c8:

    # c "I couldn’t agree more."
    c "我完全同意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:581
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_eefa933f:

    # c "And you’re feeling good otherwise?"
    c "那你其他方面感觉还好吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:583
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_88ed5cd2:

    # e "Yes, otherwise I’m feeling great."
    e "嗯，其他方面我都感觉很好。"

# game/episode022.rpy:584
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_5dbc1644:

    # e "It’s weird at times, the idea of something growing inside me."
    e "有时候会觉得奇怪，想到有个东西正在我体内生长。"

# game/episode022.rpy:585
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_3efbf856:

    # c "Exciting too!"
    c "但也很令人兴奋！"

# game/episode022.rpy:586
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_01c40558:

    # e "It sure is!"
    e "确实如此！"

# game/episode022.rpy:587
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_8d1369cd:

    # c "No morning sickness?"
    c "没有孕吐吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:588
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_5d28a474:

    # e "Thankfully no."
    e "幸好没有。"

# game/episode022.rpy:593
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_6105a8c0:

    # e "There’s something else though."
    e "不过还有件事。"

# game/episode022.rpy:595
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_327fe809:

    # e "It’s a little embarrassing."
    e "有点难以启齿。"

# game/episode022.rpy:596
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_6e6ce20e:

    # c "Oh?"
    c "哦？"

# game/episode022.rpy:597
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_b6f24c83:

    # e "I feel amped up most of the time."
    e "我大部分时间都特别兴奋。"

# game/episode022.rpy:598
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_ba2a27a9:

    # c "Amped up?"
    c "兴奋？"

# game/episode022.rpy:599
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_6ddf9fee:

    # e "Well...{w} You know...{w} Horny."
    e "就是…{w}你知道的…{w}欲火焚身。"

# game/episode022.rpy:600
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_46099848:

    # c "I’m not sure I see the problem."
    c "我不觉得这有什么问题。"

# game/episode022.rpy:601
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_60fede28:

    # e "I’m sure you don’t."
    e "你当然不觉得。"

# game/episode022.rpy:603
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_d6f2ee12:

    # e "But here I am pulling cables from a wall and getting wet because I can’t stop thinking about you."
    e "但你看我现在边从墙上拔线缆边湿透，就因为满脑子都是你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:604
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_e42f62af:

    # c "Well, if you put it that way, I think we should do something about that."
    c "好吧，既然你这么说，我觉得我们该做点什么。"

# game/episode022.rpy:605
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_79ad4c0c:

    # c "Come by my quarters once you’re done."
    c "你忙完后来我房间一趟。"

# game/episode022.rpy:607
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_4527df9f:

    # e "Mmmm, I can’t wait."
    e "嗯，我迫不及待了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:608
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_168792e7:

    # c "See you soon."
    c "待会见。"

# game/episode022.rpy:614
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_7bb22f9a:

    # c "Keep ripping out those cables with gusto then, sis!"
    c "那就继续干劲十足地扯那些电缆吧，姐妹！"

# game/episode022.rpy:616
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_a14d6d1f:

    # c "Keep ripping out those cables with gusto then!"
    c "那就继续干劲十足地扯那些电缆吧！"

# game/episode022.rpy:617
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_talk_cc107a7c:

    # e "I sure will."
    e "我当然会的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:622
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_a28cf302:

    # e "[p_name_short], could we have a word about something?"
    e "[p_name_short]，我们能谈点事吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:623
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_84d9b8e4:

    # "The sudden change in tone took me by surprise."
    "这突如其来的语气转变让我吃了一惊。"

# game/episode022.rpy:624
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_d40bb89c:

    # "Eva looked very serious."
    "伊娃看起来非常严肃。"

# game/episode022.rpy:625
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_7b7a5678:

    # c "Yes, of course."
    c "是的，当然。"

# game/episode022.rpy:626
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_861588b9:

    # e "I thought it would be a good time to be honest with each other."
    e "我觉得现在是时候彼此坦诚相待了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:628
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_9cb01624:

    # e "Especially with the baby on the way."
    e "尤其在我怀孕的情况下。"

# game/episode022.rpy:629
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_f65ab8ef:

    # "I dreaded the words that were sure to come next."
    "我害怕接下来肯定会说出口的话。"

# game/episode022.rpy:631
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_7442c1e5:

    # e "I hope you don’t think I’m stupid, [p_name_short]."
    e "希望你不会觉得我很蠢，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode022.rpy:632
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_d5258518:

    # c "No, of course not, I-"
    c "不，当然不会，我—"

# game/episode022.rpy:634
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_e6191e15:

    # e "Please, let me finish."
    e "请让我说完。"

# game/episode022.rpy:635
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_5a23a4cc:

    # e "I know I’m not the only woman you love."
    e "我知道我不是你唯一爱着的女人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:636
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_8e8a517f:

    # e "I know there are others."
    e "我知道还有别人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:637
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_1d87a6de:

    # e "What I don’t understand is why you haven’t told me."
    e "我不明白的是为什么你从没告诉过我。"

# game/episode022.rpy:638
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_a2c1b232:

    # c "There was never a right time."
    c "从来就没有合适的时机。"

# game/episode022.rpy:640
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_9434ce8e:

    # e "Sorry, [p_name_short], but that’s just bullshit."
    e "抱歉，[p_name_short]，但这完全是胡说八道。"

# game/episode022.rpy:642
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_07127b55:

    # e "I’m pregnant with our child and you didn’t think it would be a good time to tell me then?"
    e "我怀着我们的孩子，你难道不觉得那才是告诉我真相的好时机吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:643
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_e1dedcd5:

    # c "I’m sorry, Eva, I should have told you earlier."
    c "对不起，伊娃，我本该早点告诉你的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:644
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_68486c74:

    # c "I was scared I’d lose you if I told you the truth."
    c "我害怕如果说出真相就会失去你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:646
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_38e4c48c:

    # e "Lying to me could have just as easily made me break up with you."
    e "对我撒谎同样可能让我离开你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:647
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_126adf8c:

    # e "It could still."
    e "现在依然可能。"

# game/episode022.rpy:648
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_24366554:

    # c "I understand."
    c "我明白。"

# game/episode022.rpy:649
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_642c6789:

    # c "You probably don’t want to hear any justifications for my behavior, so I just wanted to say again that I’m sorry."
    c "你大概不想听我为自己的行为辩解，所以我只想再说一次：对不起。"

# game/episode022.rpy:650
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_d89434a8:

    # c "And that I won’t lie to you ever again."
    c "还有，我再也不会对你说谎了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:651
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_57a64a64:

    # c "If you don’t want anything to do with me anymore, I’d understand of course."
    c "如果你不想再和我有任何瓜葛，我当然能理解。"

# game/episode022.rpy:653
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_af63aad6:

    # c "But I’d hate for you to bear the responsibility of your pregnancy alone."
    c "但我不希望你独自承担怀孕的责任。"

# game/episode022.rpy:654
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_577831ef:

    # c "And for our child of course, once it’s been born."
    c "当然还有我们的孩子，等它出生之后。"

# game/episode022.rpy:656
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_a8f12b52:

    # e "Oh [p_name_short], don’t be silly."
    e "哦，[p_name_short]，别傻了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:657
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_72f53393:

    # e "Of course I don’t want to break up with you."
    e "我当然不想和你分手。"

# game/episode022.rpy:659
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_fc05ab38:

    # e "And I’m not going to shut you out of the life we made together."
    e "我也不会把你排除在我们共同创造的生活之外。"

# game/episode022.rpy:661
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_aeb4f690:

    # e "I’m disappointed in you, that’s true."
    e "我对你感到失望，这是真的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:662
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_2d79e361:

    # e "I also don’t want to hear anything about the girls you’re involved with."
    e "我也不想听到任何关于你牵扯的那些女孩的事。"

# game/episode022.rpy:666
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_d116b062:

    # e "I have a strong feeling my sister has sunk her claws in you."
    e "我有种强烈的感觉，我姐姐已经对你下手了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:668
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_75e7837a:

    # e "I have a strong feeling my mother has sunk her claws in you."
    e "我有种强烈的感觉，我母亲已经对你下手了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:669
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_bac9531b:

    # e "But the thing is, I want to live in blissful oblivion."
    e "但问题是，我想活在幸福的遗忘中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:670
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_bc3c1af7:

    # e "I want to feel that you’re there for me alone, that you love just me."
    e "我想感受到你只为我存在，你只爱我一个人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:671
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_c3de3cd1:

    # e "Will you be able to do that?"
    e "你能做到吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:672
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_dc56fc16:

    # c "Of course, Eva, you’re my everything."
    c "当然，伊娃，你就是我的一切。"

# game/episode022.rpy:674
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_5131871e:

    # e "Good."
    e "很好。"

# game/episode022.rpy:675
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_260e34b7:

    # e "Let’s not speak of this again and kiss me instead."
    e "我们别再提这件事了，不如吻我吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:677
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_6f52f228:

    # "I obliged her eagerly."
    "我急切地顺从了她。"

# game/episode022.rpy:679
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_1dafdceb:

    # e "I’m glad that’s settled."
    e "我很高兴这事解决了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:680
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_2803d720:

    # e "Run along now, I have cables to pull."
    e "现在走吧，我还要拉电缆呢。"

# game/episode022.rpy:682
translate simplified_chinese ep022_eva_confession_62590fd3:

    # "I mock-saluted her and took my leave, glad my behavior hadn’t done irreparable damage to our relationship."
    "我假装向她敬礼后离开了，庆幸自己的行为没有对我们的关系造成无法弥补的伤害。"

# game/episode022.rpy:689
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_43ad97a2:

    # "I returned to my quarters to the sounds of someone with a very distressed stomach."
    "我回到自己的舱室，听到有人肠胃极度不适的声音。"

# game/episode022.rpy:690
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_eb305a80:

    # "Someone was vomiting loudly in the toilet bowl."
    "有人正对着马桶大声呕吐。"

# game/episode022.rpy:692
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_b105ae8f:

    # "Startled, I found Lilly on her knees, her skin coloring a sickly green."
    "我惊讶地发现莉莉跪在地上，皮肤泛着病态的绿色。"

# game/episode022.rpy:693
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_47e8f6b7:

    # c "Are you okay, Lilly?"
    c "你还好吗，莉莉？"

# game/episode022.rpy:694
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_eb66ca72:

    # l "I’ll be okay in a minute."
    l "我马上就会好的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:696
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_4105a9a4:

    # "She heaved again, but only brought up bile."
    "她又干呕起来，但只吐出些胆汁。"

# game/episode022.rpy:698
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_f73186a6:

    # l "Well, I think that’s all of it."
    l "嗯，我想应该都吐完了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:699
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_242cf449:

    # c "Poor thing."
    c "可怜的家伙。"

# game/episode022.rpy:702
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_1b0f0db4:

    # "I helped my sister up and guided her to the bed where she sat down heavily."
    "我扶起妹妹，领她到床边，她重重地坐了下来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:704
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_25a31478:

    # "I helped Lilly up and guided her to the bed where she sat down heavily."
    "我扶起莉莉，领她到床边，她重重地坐了下来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:706
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_7d5f08b7:

    # l "I think it must have been something I ate."
    l "我想肯定是吃了什么不干净的东西。"

# game/episode022.rpy:707
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_6e3b931f:

    # l "Though it’s been happening for a few days now."
    l "不过这种情况已经持续好几天了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:708
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_73da6d53:

    # c "Eh, Lilly, could you wait here for a moment?"
    c "呃，莉莉，你能在这里等我一下吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:710
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_705a04b2:

    # l "Sure."
    l "当然。"

# game/episode022.rpy:711
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_0872680c:

    # c "Don’t go anywhere, I’ll be right back."
    c "别走开，我马上回来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:714
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_2c14d8a2:

    # "I hurried to the room where Thim was lodging, hoping I could sneak in without him being there."
    "我急忙赶到蒂姆住的房间，希望趁他不在时溜进去。"

# game/episode022.rpy:716
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_e72125e8:

    # "Of course I had no such luck."
    "当然我没那么走运。"

# game/episode022.rpy:718
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_4e41c7ec:

    # t "[p_name], why are you looking all hot and bothered?"
    t "[p_name]，你怎么看起来慌慌张张的？"

# game/episode022.rpy:719
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_37d5f8e3:

    # c "I need to borrow a body scanner."
    c "我需要借个身体扫描仪。"

# game/episode022.rpy:720
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_4124757b:

    # c "You know, one of those hand-held things."
    c "你知道的，就是那种手持的设备。"

# game/episode022.rpy:721
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_de579f9e:

    # c "We brought those from the Bastard, didn’t we?"
    c "那些是从\"私生子\"号上带来的，对吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:722
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_d9ce61de:

    # t "Yes, we did."
    t "是的，带来了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:723
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_6b123f75:

    # t "Is somebody injured?"
    t "有人受伤了吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:724
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_1c2cbaee:

    # c "No, nothing like that."
    c "不是，不是那种事。"

# game/episode022.rpy:725
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_46529fe0:

    # c "Just wanted to check on someone."
    c "只是想检查一下某人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:730
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_d09f8203:

    # t "It’s not about your sister, is it?"
    t "这跟你妹妹没关系吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:731
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_3a66d6be:

    # t "Eva, I mean."
    t "我是说伊娃。"

# game/episode022.rpy:733
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_dfa4e815:

    # t "It’s not about Eva, is it?"
    t "这跟伊娃没关系吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:735
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_d9e636d1:

    # t "Don’t worry, I’m not breaking doctor patient confidentiality."
    t "别担心，我不会泄露医患保密信息。"

# game/episode022.rpy:736
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_86587edf:

    # t "Her pregnancy showed up on a routine scan."
    t "她的怀孕是在常规扫描中发现的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:737
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_52afa635:

    # t "I know for certain I’m not the father and Kit sure as hell isn’t."
    t "我敢肯定我不是父亲，基特也绝对不是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:738
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_64b44202:

    # t "So that leaves you."
    t "所以就剩下你了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:739
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_0fd6a606:

    # c "Uh, well."
    c "呃，这个。"

# game/episode022.rpy:741
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_f640e301:

    # t "Don’t worry, [p_name_short]."
    t "别担心，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode022.rpy:743
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_a8b4f43b:

    # t "I’m sure as hell not judging."
    t "我绝对不是要评判你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:745
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_207f4f58:

    # t "You must have heard the rumors about my family."
    t "你一定听说过关于我家族的传言。"

# game/episode022.rpy:746
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_48488658:

    # t "The whole cliche about smoke and fire isn’t that farfetched."
    t "关于\"无风不起浪\"的老话还真不是空穴来风。"

# game/episode022.rpy:747
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_e4a99404:

    # t "My cousin and I...{w} Before I had to join the Navy...{w} Well, you know how these things go..."
    t "我表妹和我…{w}在我不得不加入舰队之前…{w}嗯，你知道这种事情的发展…"

# game/episode022.rpy:748
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_b0ac1550:

    # t "So congratulations and your secret is safe with me."
    t "所以恭喜你，你的秘密我会守口如瓶。"

# game/episode022.rpy:749
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_8c18fc32:

    # c "Actually, it’s not about Eva."
    c "其实，不是关于伊娃的事。"

# game/episode022.rpy:751
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_e56c05a2:

    # t "Oh, sorry for assuming-"
    t "哦，抱歉我擅自揣测—"

# game/episode022.rpy:752
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_9c7bfad4:

    # c "It’s Lilly."
    c "是莉莉。"

# game/episode022.rpy:753
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_2ca02efd:

    # c "She’s complaining about an upset stomach and thinks it’s food poisoning."
    c "她一直在抱怨胃不舒服，觉得是食物中毒。"

# game/episode022.rpy:754
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_d98756bd:

    # c "But I’m fairly certain it’s not."
    c "但我很确定不是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:756
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_7919124d:

    # t "Are you telling me that Eva’s not the only one?"
    t "你是说伊娃不是唯一一个？"

# game/episode022.rpy:757
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_01199c57:

    # c "Yes, I think Lilly is too."
    c "是的，我觉得莉莉也是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:760
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_ef106722:

    # t "Wow, two sisters, you dark horse."
    t "哇哦，姐妹双收啊，你这匹黑马。"

# game/episode022.rpy:762
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_57e2e85a:

    # t "Wow, two of your friends, you dark horse."
    t "哇哦，你的两位朋友啊，你这匹黑马。"

# game/episode022.rpy:763
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_6c2972e5:

    # t "Good for you though, I hope you’ll make them happy."
    t "不过还是恭喜你，希望你能让她们幸福。"

# game/episode022.rpy:765
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_29426656:

    # c "Lilly has an upset stomach, maybe food poisoning, so I wanted to do a body scan."
    c "莉莉胃不舒服，可能是食物中毒，所以我想做个全身扫描。"

# game/episode022.rpy:766
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_749498c8:

    # t "I can imagine her stomach is upset and I’m pretty sure it’s not food poisoning."
    t "我能想象她胃不舒服，而且我非常确定这不是食物中毒。"

# game/episode022.rpy:767
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_096d1389:

    # "I stared at Thim, dumbfounded."
    "我目瞪口呆地盯着蒂姆。"

# game/episode022.rpy:769
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_67813bf3:

    # t "Something showed up at one of her routine scans."
    t "她的一次常规扫描中出现了异常。"

# game/episode022.rpy:770
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_3951125b:

    # t "So I guess congratulations are in order."
    t "所以我想应该恭喜你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:771
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_374131f5:

    # c "Uh...{w} Thanks."
    c "呃…{w}谢谢。"

# game/episode022.rpy:773
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_f640e301_1:

    # t "Don’t worry, [p_name_short]."
    t "别担心，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode022.rpy:776
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_a8b4f43b_1:

    # t "I’m sure as hell not judging."
    t "我绝对不是在评判你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:777
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_207f4f58_1:

    # t "You must have heard the rumors about my family."
    t "你一定听说过关于我家族的传言。"

# game/episode022.rpy:778
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_48488658_1:

    # t "The whole cliche about smoke and fire isn’t that farfetched."
    t "那些关于\"无风不起浪\"的陈词滥调并非空穴来风。"

# game/episode022.rpy:779
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_e4a99404_1:

    # t "My cousin and I...{w} Before I had to join the Navy...{w} Well, you know how these things go..."
    t "我表妹和我…{w}在我不得不加入舰队之前…{w}嗯，你知道这种事情的发展…"

# game/episode022.rpy:780
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_2fbf8dd1:

    # t "Your secret is safe with me."
    t "你的秘密我会守口如瓶。"

# game/episode022.rpy:781
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_3707433b:

    # c "Thanks, Thim, that means a lot."
    c "谢谢，蒂姆，这对我意义重大。"

# game/episode022.rpy:783
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_0c5088df:

    # t "Sure thing."
    t "当然。"

# game/episode022.rpy:785
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_c3f78364:

    # t "Now, go and make your sister happy."
    t "现在，去让你妹妹开心吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:787
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_ad2d6f0c:

    # t "Now, go and make Lilly happy."
    t "现在，去让莉莉开心吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:789
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_944f7380:

    # "I ran back with the body scanner, filled with anticipation."
    "我带着身体扫描仪跑回来，满心期待。"

# game/episode022.rpy:792
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_15bac56b:

    # "I hurried to the room where we kept the first aid stuff and grabbed a body scanner."
    "我匆忙赶到存放急救用品的房间，拿了一个身体扫描仪。"

# game/episode022.rpy:794
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_f46be58a:

    # "Lilly was still waiting for me, sitting on the bed."
    "莉莉还在等我，坐在床上。"

# game/episode022.rpy:795
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_1c961be6:

    # "Some color had returned to her skin and she looked less sickly."
    "她的皮肤恢复了一些血色，看起来没那么病态了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:796
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_713f5507:

    # c "Feeling a little better?"
    c "感觉好些了吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:798
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_4564e27a:

    # l "Yes, I am."
    l "是的，我好多了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:800
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_4b6010d1:

    # l "So I don’t think there’s any need for a scan."
    l "所以我觉得没必要扫描了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:801
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_ee835ea6:

    # c "Humor me."
    c "就让我看看吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:803
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_816204f9:

    # l "Alright."
    l "好吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:805
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_1cf90533:

    # "I initiated the scanning protocol and did a full body scan of Lilly."
    "我启动扫描程序，给莉莉做了全身检查。"

# game/episode022.rpy:806
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_a411a36d:

    # "When the scanner pinged to indicate it was done I handed it to Lilly."
    "扫描仪发出提示音后，我把它递给莉莉。"

# game/episode022.rpy:807
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_7cc0cd48:

    # "I’d glanced at the report summary and it confirmed my suspicions."
    "我瞥了眼报告摘要，证实了我的猜测。"

# game/episode022.rpy:808
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_7b6c6c10:

    # "I could barely contain my joy."
    "我几乎压抑不住内心的喜悦。"

# game/episode022.rpy:810
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_7a3a2bc4:

    # l "Nothing the matter with me, is there?"
    l "我没什么问题，对吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:811
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_c7dbcff3:

    # c "Have a look yourself."
    c "你自己看看。"

# game/episode022.rpy:813
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_6111b04a:

    # "Lilly skimmed the report quickly."
    "莉莉快速浏览了报告。"

# game/episode022.rpy:815
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_63a9bbb5:

    # "Her eyes lit up when it hit her."
    "当她意识到时，眼睛亮了起来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:817
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_feb24f17:

    # l "[p_name_short]!"
    l "[p_name_short]!"

# game/episode022.rpy:818
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_b1421e36:

    # l "[p_name_short]!!!"
    l "[p_name_short]!!!"

# game/episode022.rpy:819
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_cf5fcc44:

    # c "Yes!"
    c "是的！"

# game/episode022.rpy:820
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_02f19a6a:

    # l "I’m pregnant!"
    l "我怀孕了！"

# game/episode022.rpy:826
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_bed1b257:

    # "My sister fell into my arms."
    "我的妹妹扑进了我的怀抱。"

# game/episode022.rpy:828
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_41c0a9c4:

    # "Lilly fell into my arms."
    "莉莉扑进了我的怀抱。"

# game/episode022.rpy:830
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_b14bb5da:

    # l "We’re having a baby!"
    l "我们要有宝宝了！"

# game/episode022.rpy:831
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_95ee4203:

    # c "Yes, we are."
    c "是的，我们要有宝宝了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:832
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_8574f527:

    # l "You knew, didn’t you!"
    l "你早就知道了，是不是！"

# game/episode022.rpy:833
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_74b730fa:

    # c "I had my suspicions."
    c "我确实有所怀疑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:834
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_2fc8b410:

    # c "And I wanted you to find out for yourself."
    c "而我希望你能自己发现。"

# game/episode022.rpy:836
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_0c35b16f:

    # l "And there I was, going on about some imaginary stomach bug..."
    l "而我还在那儿，一直念叨着某种臆想出来的胃病……"

# game/episode022.rpy:837
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_f67e2ccb:

    # c "Yup, I won’t lie, that was rather cute."
    c "是啊，我不骗你，那样子相当可爱。"

# game/episode022.rpy:838
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_2a33144b:

    # l "I’m so happy, [p_name_short]!"
    l "我太开心了，[p_name_short]！"

# game/episode022.rpy:839
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_c5531862:

    # c "Me too!"
    c "我也是！"

# game/episode022.rpy:841
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_53a7c440:

    # l "I can’t wait to tell Eva!"
    l "我等不及要告诉伊娃了！"

# game/episode022.rpy:842
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_cb6e2438:

    # l "And the others too."
    l "还有其他人也是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:844
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_c5410415:

    # l "I can’t wait to tell the others!"
    l "我等不及要告诉其他人了！"

# game/episode022.rpy:846
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_77af3d06:

    # l "How are we going to tell the others?"
    l "我们该怎么告诉其他人呢？"

# game/episode022.rpy:847
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_79dd7a6e:

    # c "I’m sure it’s going to be a difficult conversation, but we’ll find a way."
    c "我确信这会是个艰难的对话，但我们会找到办法的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:848
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_b5544095:

    # c "Let’s have this moment together for now, shall we?"
    c "让我们先共享此刻的时光，好吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:849
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_c8f2ad0d:

    # l "I’d like that very much."
    l "我非常乐意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:852
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_5dfefbc7:

    # "We lay together on the bed and I took my sister into my arms."
    "我们一同躺在床上，我将妹妹拥入怀中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:854
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_dc0592ba:

    # "We lay together on the bed and I took my girlfriend into my arms."
    "我们一同躺在床上，我将女友拥入怀中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:855
translate simplified_chinese ep022_lilly_talk_3016ab9d:

    # "Stroking her soft skin, we enjoyed each other’s nearness and revelled in our happiness until duty called again and we had to go our separate ways."
    "轻抚着她柔滑的肌肤，我们沉醉于彼此的亲近，纵情享受这份幸福，直到职责再次召唤，我们不得不各奔东西。"

# game/episode022.rpy:863
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_a9d2b982:

    # "I found my mother poring over several books and her tablet."
    "我发现母亲正专注地翻阅着几本书和她的平板电脑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:865
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_fbc5910e:

    # "I found Nadya poring over several books and her tablet."
    "我发现娜迪亚正专注地翻阅着几本书和她的平板电脑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:866
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_5690bc5c:

    # c "It’s like you’re always reading when I meet you."
    c "每次见到你，你似乎总是在阅读。"

# game/episode022.rpy:868
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_4706699c:

    # na "I do other stuff as well."
    na "我也会做其他事情。"

# game/episode022.rpy:869
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_57b195d4:

    # c "Sleep, eat, read, repeat?"
    c "睡觉、吃饭、阅读，周而复始？"

# game/episode022.rpy:872
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_6ec3df01:

    # na "Come now, I don’t hear you complain when I warm your bed at night."
    na "得了吧，晚上我给你暖床时可没听你抱怨过。"

# game/episode022.rpy:873
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_feed6cdd:

    # c "Good point."
    c "说得好。"

# game/episode022.rpy:875
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_adb58572:

    # na "Well, if you put it that way..."
    na "好吧，既然你这么说…"

# game/episode022.rpy:876
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_08f57b00:

    # c "I was wondering if I could pick your brain a little further about those Shixses."
    c "我在想能不能再请教你一些关于希克塞斯的事情。"

# game/episode022.rpy:878
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f712a543:

    # na "Of course."
    na "当然可以。"

# game/episode022.rpy:879
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_d5cc8c95:

    # na "I don’t know if I’ll be of much help, there’s so little known about them."
    na "不知道我能不能帮上什么忙，关于他们的资料实在太少了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:880
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_0294b670:

    # na "In fact, everything I have here on the table are all the texts that directly make mention of them."
    na "事实上，我桌上这些就是所有直接提及他们的文献了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:881
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_ae651f5b:

    # c "That’s still an impressive amount of books."
    c "这书量还是很惊人啊。"

# game/episode022.rpy:882
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_2e49afa5:

    # na "Don’t let that fool you."
    na "别被这个骗了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:883
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_3e0ecdf5:

    # na "Most of those text only reference the Shixses in one sentence and not even by name."
    na "大部分文献都只用一句话提到希克塞斯，甚至都没提名字。"

# game/episode022.rpy:884
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_158131f7:

    # c "They’re that obscure, are they?"
    c "他们竟然如此鲜为人知吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:885
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_b70432c3:

    # na "Yes."
    na "是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:886
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_dfcece00:

    # c "Weird, considering the impact they seem to have had on the universe."
    c "奇怪，考虑到他们似乎对宇宙产生过重大影响。"

# game/episode022.rpy:888
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_593af4c5:

    # na "Yes, it almost seems like there was an attempt to scrub them from history."
    na "没错，这简直像是有人试图将他们从历史中抹去。"

# game/episode022.rpy:889
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_4238c1a1:

    # c "I can imagine why."
    c "我能想象为什么。"

# game/episode022.rpy:890
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_74de3eff:

    # na "The name of their homeworld isn’t mentioned anywhere, only that they were a ruthless and needlessly cruel species, who only ventured out of their system to capture hapless victims."
    na "他们母星的名字在任何地方都未被提及，只知道他们是个残忍无情、肆意施虐的种族，离开自己星系只为了捕获不幸的受害者。"

# game/episode022.rpy:891
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_d01d8ab0:

    # c "Nothing about their genetic experiments or their forced extinction?"
    c "没有提到他们的基因实验或强制灭绝行为？"

# game/episode022.rpy:893
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_346484c0:

    # na "Nope."
    na "没有。"

# game/episode022.rpy:894
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_4d5fd618:

    # na "There are some details about a coalition that rose up to them, but nothing about the genocide."
    na "有些关于反抗他们而组建的联盟的细节，但完全没有提到种族灭绝。"

# game/episode022.rpy:895
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_764201bf:

    # c "That sure sounds like a cover up."
    c "这听起来确实像在掩盖真相。"

# game/episode022.rpy:896
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_41d176b4:

    # na "It does."
    na "确实如此。"

# game/episode022.rpy:897
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f09f179e:

    # na "I guess the Shixses foresaw their own obscuration from history, hence the creation of the prophecy."
    na "我猜希克塞斯人预见到了他们自己会被历史湮没，所以才创造了那个预言。"

# game/episode022.rpy:898
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_904e8bc0:

    # c "Nothing like a little quasi religious mumbo jumbo to fan the flames of obsession."
    c "没什么比这种准宗教的胡言乱语更能煽动人们的执念了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:900
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_0021e3f6:

    # na "Yes, it was a clever move on their part."
    na "是的，这对他们来说是个聪明的举动。"

# game/episode022.rpy:901
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_ce5bd367:

    # na "They made sure that throughout the many years since their destruction, the prophecy still lingered in the minds of people, even if the record of the Shixses own existence barely withstood the ravages of time."
    na "他们确保在自己毁灭后的这么多年里，即使关于希克塞斯人存在的记录几乎没能经受住时间的摧残，这个预言仍然萦绕在人们的脑海中。"

# game/episode022.rpy:902
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_1f56871e:

    # c "Do you think my father is one of those people?"
    c "你觉得我父亲是那些人之一吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:904
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_73ac9f3d:

    # na "He sure is now."
    na "他现在肯定是了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:906
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_0c470c96:

    # c "I meant before, when he was with you, I mean."
    c "我是说以前，当他还和你在一起的时候。"

# game/episode022.rpy:907
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_6d8feecf:

    # na "I’ve thought about it so much, even after I confessed everything back on Kepler."
    na "我想了很多，即使在开普勒星上我坦白了一切之后。"

# game/episode022.rpy:909
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f704e7e7:

    # na "I told you he went away to train at a trade conglomerate and came back changed."
    na "我告诉过你他离开去一个贸易集团接受培训，回来后就变了个人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:910
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_1d1715c8:

    # na "He became even more ambitious and obsessed with his legacy."
    na "他变得更加雄心勃勃，并且执着于自己的传承。"

# game/episode022.rpy:911
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_e5b5e0ab:

    # na "I think his tenure at that conglomerate is also when he was first exposed to the contents of the prophecy."
    na "我认为他在那个企业集团的任职期间，也是他首次接触到预言内容的时候。"

# game/episode022.rpy:912
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_1476c90c:

    # na "The conglomerate wanted a full profile of its interns, so before Agust went away, there were all kinds of physical tests and medical examinations."
    na "企业集团要求对实习生进行全面评估，所以阿古斯特离开前接受了各种体能测试和医学检查。"

# game/episode022.rpy:913
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_3d67b7c3:

    # na "Maybe some disciple took a look at his genetic profile and pulled him into the conspiracy."
    na "也许某个信徒看了他的基因图谱，然后把他拉进了这个阴谋。"

# game/episode022.rpy:914
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_b94ad783:

    # na "After it turned out that Yve couldn’t conceive, he came back to me."
    na "在发现伊芙无法生育后，他回到了我身边。"

# game/episode022.rpy:915
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_e2990f5e:

    # na "I realize now that it was all an act, in order for me to conceive the children he desired."
    na "我现在意识到那全是演戏，为的是让我怀上他想要的孩子们。"

# game/episode022.rpy:916
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_e2ad6975:

    # na "He was obsessed with the medical details surrounding your birth and your sister’s."
    na "他对你们姐妹出生时的医疗细节非常着迷。"

# game/episode022.rpy:917
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_847a7301:

    # na "The amount of tests that he demanded to be run even confounded the doctors who delivered you."
    na "他要求进行的检查数量之多，甚至让接生你们的医生都感到困惑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:918
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_b1208bba:

    # na "What those test showed him must have satisfied Agust, because his interest waned after that."
    na "那些测试结果一定让阿古斯特很满意，因为在那之后他的兴趣就减弱了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:919
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f78b0707:

    # c "Until now."
    c "直到现在。"

# game/episode022.rpy:921
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_7ff15310:

    # na "Yes, until now."
    na "是的，直到现在。"

# game/episode022.rpy:923
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_1f19a87f:

    # c "I meant before, back on Tuolovi."
    c "我是说以前，在图洛维的时候。"

# game/episode022.rpy:925
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_91726fa1:

    # na "I’ve thought about it so much, even after I told you about his attempted rape and his threats concerning Aven’s mother."
    na "我想过很多次，甚至在我告诉你他企图强奸和威胁艾文母亲的事情之后还在想。"

# game/episode022.rpy:926
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_4ee4a694:

    # c "That he might have murdered her or have her killed?"
    c "他可能谋杀或派人杀害了她？"

# game/episode022.rpy:927
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_b70432c3_1:

    # na "Yes."
    na "是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:928
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_fe9bad89:

    # na "Agust sees people as tools, that shouldn’t come as a surprise."
    na "阿古斯特把人都看作工具，这并不令人意外。"

# game/episode022.rpy:929
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_cfcdc447:

    # na "Knowing what we know now, I don’t think it’s a coincidence Aven, Lilly and Eva were all living on the Valenmann de Lonval estate."
    na "根据我们现在知道的情况，我认为艾文、莉莉和伊娃都住在瓦伦曼·德·隆瓦尔庄园并非巧合。"

# game/episode022.rpy:930
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_e4e92ebe:

    # c "What, because he secretly sired Aven, Lilly and Eva?"
    c "什么，因为他秘密地生下了艾文、莉莉和伊娃？"

# game/episode022.rpy:931
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_4022bd77:

    # c "Because that would-"
    c "因为那样会-"

# game/episode022.rpy:932
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_2361aa7b:

    # na "No, no, I don’t mean it like that."
    na "不，不，我不是那个意思。"

# game/episode022.rpy:933
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_e3cc94e1:

    # na "Aven was already born when her mother came to work for Agust."
    na "艾文的母亲来为阿古斯特工作时，艾文已经出生了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:934
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_fff4b69e:

    # na "And the mothers of Lilly and Eva were already pregnant before they even met him."
    na "而莉莉和伊娃的母亲在认识他之前就已经怀孕了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:935
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_58887dfe:

    # na "So he isn’t their father, but I think the hiring of them all was no accident."
    na "所以他不是她们的父亲，但我认为雇佣她们所有人并非偶然。"

# game/episode022.rpy:936
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_a2e55587:

    # na "Agust insisted on full medical tests for them, blood work, genetic mapping, the works."
    na "阿古斯特坚持要对她们进行全面的医疗检查，包括血液检查、基因图谱分析等全套项目。"

# game/episode022.rpy:937
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_55cc7427:

    # na "The amount of tests even confounded the doctors who were requested to carry them out."
    na "检查的数量之多甚至让被要求执行这些检查的医生都感到困惑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:938
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_1b1db747:

    # na "When Lilly and Eva were born the same batch of tests was run on them, all under the guise of making sure the babies were healthy and got the best possible care."
    na "当莉莉和伊娃出生时，同样的检查也在她们身上进行，全都打着确保婴儿健康并获得最佳护理的幌子。"

# game/episode022.rpy:939
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f11586f7:

    # c "Yes, a loving and caring employer, that’s my father to a tee."
    c "没错，一个充满爱心和关怀的雇主，这完全就是我父亲的作风。"

# game/episode022.rpy:940
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_84ceb9d7:

    # c "So you’re saying he was testing my friends for something?"
    c "所以你是说他在测试我的朋友们，为了某种目的？"

# game/episode022.rpy:942
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_2c249e55:

    # na "I think he was."
    na "我认为是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:943
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_b1208bba_1:

    # na "What those test showed him must have satisfied Agust, because his interest waned after that."
    na "那些检查结果一定让阿古斯特很满意，因为此后他的兴趣就减弱了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:944
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_f78b0707_1:

    # c "Until now."
    c "直到现在。"

# game/episode022.rpy:945
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_7ff15310_1:

    # na "Yes, until now."
    na "是的，直到现在。"

# game/episode022.rpy:946
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_20a85ab9:

    # c "So he knew about the prophecy when we were all little?"
    c "所以在我们都还小的时候，他就知道这个预言了？"

# game/episode022.rpy:947
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_87aad454:

    # na "I think so, yes."
    na "我想是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:948
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_3d578b66:

    # na "I’m not sure when it started, but he travelled a lot in his younger years and he apprenticed at some big trade conglomerate."
    na "我不确定是什么时候开始的，但他年轻时经常旅行，还在某个大型贸易集团当过学徒。"

# game/episode022.rpy:949
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_79dfe61e:

    # na "From what I know of these conglomerates, is that they attract all kinds of people."
    na "据我对这些集团的了解，它们会吸引各种各样的人。"

# game/episode022.rpy:950
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_bb7fee4a:

    # c "Including disciples of ancient prophecies with a knack for recruiting."
    c "包括那些擅长招募、信奉古老预言的追随者。"

# game/episode022.rpy:951
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_9a84f6ea:

    # na "I suspect so."
    na "我怀疑是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:953
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_a952025e:

    # na "He must have been initiated at a young age and his subsequent actions have all been influenced by it."
    na "他一定在很年轻的时候就被吸纳了，而他之后的所有行动都受此影响。"

# game/episode022.rpy:954
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_d8eba83f:

    # na "As I said, Agust regards people as tools."
    na "正如我所说，阿古斯特把人视作工具。"

# game/episode022.rpy:955
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_84ca1574:

    # c "And here I thought I couldn’t hate him more."
    c "而我还以为自己没法更恨他了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:957
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_612f16ef:

    # na "Yes, the Agust of my youth has long gone."
    na "是的，我年少时认识的阿古斯特早已不复存在。"

# game/episode022.rpy:958
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_13005041:

    # na "And it’s imperative that he doesn’t get his hands on the technology in that temple."
    na "至关重要的是，绝不能让他染指那座神庙里的科技。"

# game/episode022.rpy:960
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_ad8d1479:

    # na "It’s imperative that he doesn’t get his hands on the technology in that temple."
    na "至关重要的是，绝不能让他染指那座神庙里的科技。"

# game/episode022.rpy:962
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_5ee56570:

    # na "I mean, the people he surrounds himself are bad enough, but I think their ambitions pale in comparison to his."
    na "我是说，他身边那些人已经够糟糕了，但我觉得他们的野心比起他的简直微不足道。"

# game/episode022.rpy:963
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_5627bddc:

    # c "Noted, we’re going to scorch that temple and then move on to any other structure left on this planet."
    c "明白了，我们会把那座神庙烧成灰烬，然后清理这颗星球上剩下的所有建筑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:964
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_ccb084fe:

    # na "Good."
    na "很好。"

# game/episode022.rpy:966
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_540270af:

    # na "I’ll see if I can find any more about the Shixses, but I wouldn’t get my hopes up."
    na "我会看看能不能找到更多关于希克塞斯的线索，但别抱太大希望。"

# game/episode022.rpy:967
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_c52dccfe:

    # c "Thank you anyway, for trying."
    c "无论如何，谢谢你尽力帮忙。"

# game/episode022.rpy:970
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_fa7476a7:

    # "I left my mother to it and went back to my quarters."
    "我让母亲继续她的工作，自己回到了住处。"

# game/episode022.rpy:972
translate simplified_chinese ep022_nadya_talk_587d4f4c:

    # "I left Nadya to it and went back to my quarters."
    "我把娜迪亚留在那儿，回到了自己的舱室。"

# game/episode022.rpy:979
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_fab4e9fe:

    # c "Is it safe to come in?"
    c "方便进来吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:980
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_04ea1b6f:

    # th "Yup, nothing’s going to blow up."
    th "嗯，不会有什么东西爆炸的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:981
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_8349736e:

    # th "Not yet, anyway."
    th "至少现在不会。"

# game/episode022.rpy:982
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_3d54811a:

    # c "That sounds reassuring."
    c "听起来真让人放心。"

# game/episode022.rpy:983
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_0ba8101e:

    # c "What are you working on?"
    c "你在忙什么？"

# game/episode022.rpy:985
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_d2423510:

    # th "I’m trying to set up the detonators, so that we have a good spread of explosions once we hit the button."
    th "我在安装引爆装置，这样我们按下按钮时就能实现大范围的爆炸效果。"

# game/episode022.rpy:986
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_d86659f8:

    # c "Do you think it will work?"
    c "你觉得这计划能成功吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:987
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_f88f44f6:

    # c "I mean, considering parts of the planet were nuked without leaving as much as a scratch."
    c "我是说，考虑到这个星球的部分区域被核弹轰过却连个划痕都没留下。"

# game/episode022.rpy:988
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_31bf4c79:

    # th "I’m pretty confident."
    th "我相当有信心。"

# game/episode022.rpy:989
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_251f3140:

    # th "The exterior of the buildings seems to be impenetrable, as we learned in the simulation."
    th "建筑外部似乎坚不可摧，正如我们在模拟中所了解的那样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:990
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_070384f6:

    # th "But the interior breaks just as easily as the Bastard’s."
    th "但内部结构会和\"私生子\"号一样容易破坏。"

# game/episode022.rpy:991
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_1c45be1e:

    # c "You did some test, I assume?"
    c "我想你做过一些测试吧？"

# game/episode022.rpy:992
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_dc11d64a:

    # th "Yes, I ran some tests and there’s no reason to think the interior is as indestructible as the outside."
    th "是的，我进行了一些测试，没有理由认为内部会像外部那样坚不可摧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:993
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_cb8efe64:

    # c "And by tests, you mean you blew shit up?"
    c "你说的测试，是指你炸毁了一些东西吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:995
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_c013a1dc:

    # th "That’s exactly what I mean."
    th "正是如此。"

# game/episode022.rpy:996
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_139c6bba:

    # c "Good."
    c "很好。"

# game/episode022.rpy:997
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_414a6b8d:

    # c "Do you think we’ll be able to clean the entire planet?"
    c "你觉得我们能清理整个星球吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:999
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_93100c48:

    # th "Céline and Jade are mapping all the locations where buildings can be found."
    th "瑟琳和杰德正在标记所有能找到建筑物的位置。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1000
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_acd0ebba:

    # th "It’s slow-going, but we’re getting there."
    th "进展虽然缓慢，但我们正在取得进展。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1001
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_ec51a9cd:

    # th "Our only enemy is time in this case."
    th "这种情况下我们唯一的敌人就是时间。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1002
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_fb851412:

    # th "Because if your father is still hot on our tail and comes barging in, the fun will definitely be over."
    th "因为你父亲要是还紧追不舍突然闯进来，那乐子肯定就结束了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1003
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_24914cae:

    # c "Yeah, we’re in a hurry no matter what."
    c "是啊，不管怎样我们都得抓紧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1004
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_364fc1c3:

    # c "Are we monitoring atmospheric entries?"
    c "我们在监控大气层进入情况吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1006
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_532664f4:

    # th "Céline says that’s impossible with all the static in the air."
    th "瑟琳说因为大气中全是静电干扰，这根本办不到。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1007
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_15bc9498:

    # c "So we won’t know when we get unwelcome company?"
    c "所以有不速之客来的时候我们也不会知道？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1009
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_a15b8f2e:

    # th "Yes, essentially."
    th "对，基本上是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1010
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_1e80c200:

    # c "Nothing that can be done about that, for now."
    c "目前对此无能为力。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1011
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_8726073a:

    # c "We need the Bastard at hand, otherwise I’d have sent a skeleton crew up to monitor the situation from the planet’s orbit."
    c "我们需要\"私生子\"号随时待命，否则我早就派个基本船员小组去行星轨道上监测情况了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1012
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_246bb4c1:

    # c "Do we have enough explosive material?"
    c "我们的爆炸物够用吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1014
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_f04272e6:

    # th "There’s enough material to salvage in the compounds, so I think we should be fine."
    th "化合物里有足够的材料可以回收利用，所以我觉得我们应该没问题。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1015
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_de5e14f8:

    # th "Setting fire to everything could work as well, but it’s not as thorough."
    th "把一切都点火烧掉也行，但不够彻底。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1016
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_44cad404:

    # c "Glad to know we have at least that option."
    c "很高兴知道我们至少还有这个选择。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1017
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_b51241ea:

    # c "Well, I’ll leave you to it."
    c "好吧，我不打扰你们了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1018
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_7a8da528:

    # c "Just don’t blow yourself up."
    c "只是别把自己炸飞了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1019
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_0a12eb80:

    # th "Not my first time handling explosives, [p_name_short]."
    th "这可不是我第一次处理炸药了，[p_name_short]。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1020
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_bb78aab7:

    # c "I know."
    c "我知道。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1024
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_5d38e919:

    # c "Still, I would hate to lose you."
    c "不过，我还是不想失去你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1027
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_3a210adb:

    # th "Hey, [p_name_short]?"
    th "嘿，[p_name_short]？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1028
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_58cd880a:

    # th "Working on this gave me a lot of time to think about our conversation earlier."
    th "做这个工作让我有很多时间来思考我们之前的谈话。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1031
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_4c6da10f:

    # th "About being intimate with your other conquests, I mean."
    th "关于和你其他\"战利品\"亲密接触的事，我是说。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1033
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_58338bdd:

    # th "About being intimate with your other conquest, I mean."
    th "关于和你另一个\"战利品\"亲密接触的事，我是说。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1034
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_5d8c3f57:

    # th "And I’ve decided life’s too short to get hung up on things like that."
    th "而且我已经想通了，人生苦短，不该为这种事纠结。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1035
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_a7c064b4:

    # th "So I’m all in."
    th "所以我完全接受。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1036
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_d7fdb88e:

    # c "That’s great to hear."
    c "很高兴听你这么说。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1039
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_ed639fd8:

    # th "All of the women on the crew are wonderful, so I guess it’s not much of a punishment to get involved with them."
    th "船上的所有女性都很棒，所以我想和她们发生关系也不算是什么惩罚。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1041
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_be227fd7:

    # th "She is wonderful, so I guess it’s not much of a punishment to get involved with her."
    th "她确实很棒，所以我想和她发生关系也不算是什么惩罚。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1042
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_23e0a2c8:

    # c "I couldn’t agree more."
    c "我完全同意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1044
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_80e27cac:

    # th "Just wanted to let you know."
    th "只是想让你知道。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1046
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_9c7e797e:

    # th "Now go, I’ve got shit to blow up."
    th "现在走吧，我还有东西要炸呢。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1047
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_73857268:

    # "Despite her curtness, Thyia smiled as she said those words."
    "尽管她语气简短，但塞娅说这些话时是带着微笑的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1049
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_15c778ec:

    # "I couldn’t help but move in and kiss her."
    "我忍不住凑上前去吻了她。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1050
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_84b9c92b:

    # c "See you around."
    c "回头见。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1054
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_4951f59a:

    # "I could tell she liked hearing that, so I moved in and kissed her."
    "我能看出她听到这句话很高兴，于是我凑上前吻了她。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1056
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_6cbc0fa6:

    # th "What was that for?"
    th "这是为什么？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1057
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_edee320d:

    # c "Just for being you."
    c "只因为你就是你。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1059
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_aa9706f1:

    # th "Are you going all sappy on me now?"
    th "你现在是在对我甜言蜜语吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1060
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_d592a418:

    # c "That’s just what girls playing with high-grade explosives do to me."
    c "这就是玩高级炸药的女孩子对我的影响。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1061
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_90ce81b8:

    # c "So hot."
    c "太性感了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1063
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_46163648:

    # th "I’m sure that’s it, Romeo."
    th "我确信就是这样，罗密欧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1065
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_9c7e797e_1:

    # th "Now go, I’ve got shit to blow up."
    th "现在走吧，我还有一堆东西要炸。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1067
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_573a7eac:

    # c "Still, I would hate to lose our star engineer."
    c "不过，我还是很不愿意失去我们的明星工程师。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1069
translate simplified_chinese ep022_thyia_talk_2b14c1b2:

    # th "Duly noted."
    th "知道了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1076
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_9ae581cc:

    # "Ziv was sitting outside, overlooking the dreary landscape of Petrarch."
    "基芙正坐在外面，俯瞰着彼特拉克沉闷的景色。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1077
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_1a8b4274:

    # c "Enjoying the view?"
    c "欣赏风景吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1078
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_952c9c6e:

    # zi "There’s not much to enjoy."
    zi "没什么可欣赏的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1079
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_7c1c16d5:

    # zi "This place is so oppressive."
    zi "这地方太压抑了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1080
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_23e0a2c8:

    # c "I couldn’t agree more."
    c "我完全同意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1081
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_16799f54:

    # c "Mind if I join you for a bit?"
    c "介意我陪你坐会儿吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1082
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_e93810a3:

    # zi "Have a seat."
    zi "请坐。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1083
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_c60e3124:

    # c "So, how’s my favorite Rhenkoy?"
    c "所以，我最喜欢的伦科伊人过得怎么样？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1085
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_5f5db703:

    # zi "Doing pretty well, even considering the surroundings."
    zi "还不错，虽然周围环境不怎么样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1086
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_5fd3eacf:

    # c "Yeah, Petrarch truly is a shithole."
    c "是啊，彼特拉克真是个鸟不拉屎的地方。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1087
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_83b4734e:

    # c "But we should be leaving soon, after we’ve blown the place up."
    c "不过我们很快就能离开了，等把这地方炸飞之后。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1089
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_72c8a64b:

    # zi "Good, maybe then we can look forward to the future."
    zi "很好，也许那时候我们就能展望未来了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1090
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_a89a0d91:

    # c "That would be nice."
    c "那倒是不错。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1091
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_901ea94d:

    # c "I would like to spend that future with you of course, but maybe you have anything particular in mind?"
    c "我当然想和你共度未来，不过你有什么特别的想法吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1093
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_c0c027bd:

    # "Ziv took my hand and squeezed it affectionately."
    "基芙握住我的手，深情地捏了捏。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1094
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_dd68ac3b:

    # zi "Maybe that’s just enough."
    zi "也许这样就足够了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1097
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_0ec95d67:

    # mod "There won't be an option for anal sex in the following scene with this choice."
    mod "选择这个选项后，接下来的场景中将不会有肛交的选项。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1099
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_13251290:

    # c "Maybe."
    c "或许吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1100
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4306f2c1:

    # c "I was thinking though, we haven’t really talked about it, but do you know how compatible we are?"
    c "不过我在想，我们其实还没真正谈过，但你知道我们之间的兼容性如何吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1101
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_ca70c704:

    # zi "Considering the great times we’ve had so far, I’d say we’re very compatible."
    zi "考虑到我们至今拥有的美好时光，我会说我们非常契合。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1102
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2935dd2a:

    # c "No argument there, but that’s not really what I meant."
    c "这点我同意，但那并不是我真正想说的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1103
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_3b99799d:

    # c "I know it’s a long shot, but I was hoping you knew if humans and Rhenkoy are genetically compatible."
    c "我知道这希望渺茫，但我希望你能知道人类和伦科伊人是否在基因上兼容。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1105
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4bc8f337:

    # zi "You mean in order to conceive children?"
    zi "你是指为了生育孩子吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1106
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_26eefe0a:

    # c "Yes."
    c "是的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1107
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2de3e36d:

    # c "I know it’s rare, but also that compatibility exists in a small number of species."
    c "我知道这很罕见，但也知道少数物种间确实存在这种兼容性。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1108
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_51903e77:

    # c "You don’t have to answer if I’ve just involuntarily insulted you by jumping ahead a hundred sacred levels of Rhenkoy Companionship."
    c "如果我无意中冒犯了你，一下子跳过了伦科伊伴侣关系的上百个神圣阶段，你可以不用回答。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1110
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4ccf4f3e:

    # zi "I think we’re well past caring about all those rules."
    zi "我想我们已经完全不在乎那些规则了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1111
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_c5c117d7:

    # c "Yes, I think so too."
    c "是的，我也这么想。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1113
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_fc5762f3:

    # zi "Why are you asking about all this though?"
    zi "不过你问这些是为什么呢？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1114
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_8fa0f0ee:

    # zi "Do you want children?"
    zi "你想要孩子吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1115
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_8a29e1eb:

    # c "Yes, I do."
    c "是的，我想要。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1116
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_6e486f99:

    # c "With you, if there’s a chance."
    c "如果有可能的话，想和你一起。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1117
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_ba4a77f8:

    # zi "Yes, I believe there is."
    zi "是的，我相信是有可能的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1119
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_6cf6a3fa:

    # zi "There’s a reason the Rhenkoy are so often involved in humanitarian efforts and diplomatic missions."
    zi "伦科伊人如此频繁地参与人道主义工作和外交任务是有原因的。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1120
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2a4af3fe:

    # zi "Empathy and adaptability are often cited as general characteristics of our species."
    zi "同理心和适应性常被列为我们的物种普遍特征。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1121
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_f9ced2fb:

    # c "All good qualities in a future mother, I’d presume."
    c "我猜这些都是未来母亲该具备的好品质吧。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1122
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_009cc907:

    # zi "True, but that’s not the reason why I mention it."
    zi "没错，但这不是我提起这件事的原因。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1123
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_34392684:

    # zi "The adaptability goes quite far and isn’t just mental, but physical too."
    zi "这种适应性的范围非常广泛，不仅体现在精神层面，身体层面也是如此。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1124
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_7eb68e69:

    # zi "Our bodies can welcome the sperm of any species and allow it to fertilise our eggs."
    zi "我们的身体能够接纳任何物种的精子，并允许其与我们的卵子结合受孕。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1125
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_855af6b4:

    # zi "It’s not something done often, but there are cases of Rhenkoy acting as surrogate mothers for other species."
    zi "虽然这种情况并不常见，但确实存在伦科伊人为其他物种代孕的案例。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1126
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_98400f39:

    # c "You’re saying Rhenkoy can get pregnant by a non-Rhenkoy male by just willing it to be?"
    c "你是说伦科伊女性只要意愿允许，就能怀上非伦科伊男性的孩子？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1128
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_296c608f:

    # zi "Not exactly, but close enough."
    zi "不完全是，但差不多就是这个意思。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1129
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2d7eb514:

    # c "And is this true for any Rhenkoy?"
    c "这对所有伦科伊人都适用吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1131
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_543e855a:

    # zi "Yes, it is."
    zi "是的，都适用。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1132
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4de65512:

    # c "I never knew..."
    c "我从来都不知道…"

# game/episode022.rpy:1133
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_95f45f89:

    # zi "It’s not something we advertize widely, people with bad intentions might take notice."
    zi "这不是我们会广泛宣传的事情，可能会被心怀不轨的人注意到。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1134
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_038fcbbc:

    # c "Yes, I can imagine."
    c "是的，我能想象。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1135
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_98d2d185:

    # c "Rhenkoy breeding farms..."
    c "伦科伊繁殖农场…"

# game/episode022.rpy:1137
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_1e03c871:

    # "Ziv shuddered at the thought and looked deep into my eyes."
    "基芙想到这不禁打了个寒颤，深深地注视着我的眼睛。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1138
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_ab84a546:

    # zi "So, coming back to your question."
    zi "那么，回到你的问题。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1140
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_c401a350:

    # zi "Yes, we are compatible. "
    zi "是的，我们是相容的。 "

# game/episode022.rpy:1141
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_80888328:

    # zi "And I feel so stupid for not bringing it up earlier."
    zi "我真觉得自己太蠢了，居然没早点提起这事。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1142
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4e5a4202:

    # c "Why?"
    c "为什么？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1144
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_47750868:

    # zi "Because I’d want nothing more than to have a child with you!"
    zi "因为我最想要的就是和你有个孩子！"

# game/episode022.rpy:1145
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_1e43790d:

    # zi "I was too afraid to bring it up, thinking it might have scared you off."
    zi "我太害怕提起这件事，担心可能会把你吓跑。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1146
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_cac27495:

    # c "I don’t scare that easily, Ziv, I can handle it."
    c "我没那么容易被吓到，基芙，我能承受得住。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1147
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_89cb9c01:

    # zi "I’m so happy to hear you say that."
    zi "听你这么说我太开心了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1148
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_58414f1e:

    # zi "Maybe there was also some leftover reticence because of my Rhenkoy beliefs about handling relationships."
    zi "也许还残留着一些顾虑，因为我的伦科伊信仰对处理关系的看法。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1149
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_b63c87a3:

    # c "Yes, I do realize we’re still going at all this at breakneck speed from a Rhenkoy standpoint."
    c "是的，我确实意识到从伦科伊的角度来看，我们进展得还是太快了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1150
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2e86b6f6:

    # c "But I’m so glad we had this conversation."
    c "但我很高兴我们进行了这次对话。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1151
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_c4fc5675:

    # c "So we’re going to try for a baby?"
    c "所以我们要尝试要个孩子吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1153
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_69390a38:

    # zi "Yes, we are."
    zi "是的，我们要。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1154
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_630ed6be:

    # c "That makes me so happy."
    c "这让我非常开心。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1155
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_7b5279d3:

    # zi "Me too."
    zi "我也是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1156
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_13690ba8:

    # zi "I can’t believe I hesitated broaching the subject with you."
    zi "真不敢相信我竟然犹豫要不要和你提起这个话题。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1157
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_51461662:

    # c "Have you thought about it for long?"
    c "你考虑这件事很久了吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1159
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_0ea8ed74:

    # zi "On and off."
    zi "断断续续地想过。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1160
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_dc6337c2:

    # zi "So much happened to us, I didn’t really have the time to get my bearings."
    zi "经历了这么多事，我确实没时间好好理清头绪。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1161
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_8873157e:

    # zi "But becoming a mother is something that has buzzed around in my mind almost immediately after we acknowledged our feelings for each other."
    zi "但自从我们确认彼此感情后，成为母亲这个念头几乎立刻就在我脑海中盘旋。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1162
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_6e39cd9b:

    # c "Same for me."
    c "我也是。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1163
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_4e820d7f:

    # c "Say, why don’t we go inside and continue this conversation in my quarters?"
    c "对了，要不要进我舱室继续聊？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1165
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_93335af3:

    # zi "I can imagine where that conversation will lead us..."
    zi "我能想象这场谈话会引向何处…"

# game/episode022.rpy:1167
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_58d4fc8b:

    # "We sat in companionable silence for a while."
    "我们惬意地沉默了片刻。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1168
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_386a6cf2:

    # c "Are there any places you would like to visit?"
    c "有什么想去的地方吗？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1170
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_bed61a95:

    # zi "Plenty."
    zi "多得很。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1171
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_bc74ea19:

    # zi "There’s this planet covered in a vast ocean."
    zi "有个被广阔海洋覆盖的星球。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1172
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_49e6d99a:

    # zi "They allow a very small amount of tourists on the only island on the planet every year."
    zi "他们每年只允许极少数游客登上该星球唯一的岛屿。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1173
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_b1e70b2c:

    # zi "The people who’ve been there say it’s an amazing place to go diving."
    zi "去过那里的人们都说，那是个绝佳的潜水胜地。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1174
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_a5b00381:

    # zi "The world under water is indescribable, or so I’ve heard."
    zi "水下的世界难以言表，至少我听说是这样。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1175
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_aa1587d9:

    # c "That sounds like a magical place."
    c "听起来像是个充满魔力的地方。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1177
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_a06b44ab:

    # zi "It sure does."
    zi "确实如此。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1178
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_3df30a46:

    # c "Maybe we can go there, when all this is over."
    c "也许等这一切结束后，我们可以去那里。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1179
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_f53e5d7d:

    # c "Go diving together."
    c "一起去潜水。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1181
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_a39b9f8f:

    # zi "I’d like that very much."
    zi "我非常乐意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1182
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_ab729f6f:

    # c "It’s a date then."
    c "那就这么约定了。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1183
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_9e666a90:

    # "Ziv smiled at me and we kissed in the feeble light of the washed-out suns."
    "基芙对我微笑着，我们在黯淡日光的微弱光芒中亲吻。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1185
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_44545fe2:

    # zi "Just to move things back into the here and now."
    zi "只是为了把思绪拉回到此时此地。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1186
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_8e84e0df:

    # zi "I haven’t seen the inside of your quarters yet."
    zi "我还没见过你房间内部呢。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1187
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_f94a600b:

    # c "You’re missing out, it’s a beautiful place, maybe just as drab as the decor outside."
    c "那你可错过好地方了，那里很美—也许和外边的装饰一样单调。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1188
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_131a3d4e:

    # zi "Sounds exciting."
    zi "听起来真令人兴奋。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1189
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_2d11243b:

    # c "Well then, what are we waiting for?"
    c "那我们还等什么？"

# game/episode022.rpy:1190
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_dd3dc29a:

    # c "Let’s get inside!"
    c "快进去吧！"

# game/episode022.rpy:1192
translate simplified_chinese ep022_ziv_talk_97843038:

    # "I led a smirking Ziv inside the compound and we hurried to my quarters."
    "我领着窃笑的基芙走进基地，匆忙赶往我的住处。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1201
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_1115176a:

    # "After loading up the explosive contraptions made by Thyia, we headed out to the temple with the Bastard."
    "装上塞娅制作的爆炸装置后，我们乘着\"私生子\"号前往神殿。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1203
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_23df5fa0:

    # "Kit and I hauled the bombs out of the cargo hold and ferried them inside the temple."
    "基特和我把炸弹从货舱搬出来，运进神殿内部。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1204
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_51e47f2c:

    # "Thyia, Céline Jade and Aven busied themselves with rigging the necessary cables."
    "塞娅、瑟琳、杰德和艾文忙着铺设必要的电缆。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1206
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_aa6e3537:

    # ki "I didn’t like this temple from the get go, but since you told us about that simulation, I hate it with a passion."
    ki "我一开始就不喜欢这座神殿，但自从你告诉我们那个模拟实验后，我对它简直深恶痛绝。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1207
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_88df38a7:

    # c "Agreed."
    c "同意。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1208
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_d6a3318c:

    # c "Let’s hope blowing it up from the inside somehow improves it."
    c "希望从内部炸掉能多少让它变得顺眼点。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1213
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_9431ebcb:

    # "We’d rigged nearly half of the explosives, when our comms started to ping."
    "我们刚装好近半数的炸药，通讯器就响了起来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1215
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_05913cd2:

    # "When I saw Thim was trying to contact us, I started to worry."
    "看到是蒂姆试图联系我们，我开始担心起来。"

# game/episode022.rpy:1216
translate simplified_chinese ep022_temple_hostiles_132a9b76:

    # c "Hey Thim, is everything okay?"
